{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://klap.cl/schemas/knowledge-mcp/tools.json",
  "_descripcion": "Contrato de herramientas que el Dev-Kit espera de cualquier servidor MCP de Klap Knowledge (mock local o servicio real). El Dev-Kit sólo conoce esta interfaz — nunca Neo4j/Graphiti, Git+SQLite ni ningún otro detalle de implementación. Formato de cada entrada: definición de tool MCP (name, description, inputSchema) más outputSchema informativo (no forma parte del protocolo MCP, pero fija el contrato para el mock y los tests).",
  "contractVersion": "2.3.0",
  "_nota_v2": "v2.0.0 agrega memoria estructurada de producto (obtener_producto, historial_producto, estado_fuentes) y la única vía de escritura real (aplicar_patch_memoria). targeted_sync queda deprecated (acuse degradado, no reprocesa nada) mientras agents/documentador.md y agents/documentador-klap.md migran; eliminación real prevista para 3.0.0 — no eliminar antes.",
  "_nota_v2_1": "v2.1.0 agrega producto_por_epica: tool de lectura, aditiva y retrocompatible (minor, no major) — resuelve determinísticamente qué producto corresponde a una épica Jira contra los cursores de sources.yaml, cerrando el gate de producto de fase 1 de /klap:trabajar-hu sin depender sólo de buscar_producto (heurístico por texto libre).",
  "_nota_v2_2": "v2.2.0 agrega la operación update_identity al oneOf de aplicar_patch_memoria — aditiva y retrocompatible (minor, no major): ningún patch válido contra 2.1.0 deja de serlo. Habilita escribir product.name/aliases después de la creación (product.aliases ya existía en product.schema.json y en la lectura de obtener_producto desde 2.0.0, pero no tenía vía de escritura). Ver docs/contrato-v2.2-propuesta.md en klap-dev-kit-knowledge.",
  "_nota_v2_3": "v2.3.0 agrega la operación upsert_component al oneOf de aplicar_patch_memoria y el valor 'repo' a source_ref.type — aditiva y retrocompatible (minor, no major). Klap Knowledge pasa a ser la única fuente de verdad de los componentes: klap-dev-kit eliminó component.yaml (ver PR chore/eliminar-component-yaml), y hasta ahora ninguna operación de patch podía crear memory/components/<id>.yaml, dejando upsert_component_link permanentemente inutilizable. 'component-yaml' en source_ref.type queda deprecado (no eliminado) y se retira en 3.0.0. Ver docs/contrato-v2.3-propuesta.md en klap-dev-kit-knowledge.",
  "no_lectura": ["targeted_sync", "aplicar_patch_memoria"],
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "producto_por_epica",
      "description": "Resuelve determinísticamente a qué producto Klap pertenece una épica Jira, consultando los cursores de sincronización registrados por producto (sources.yaml → jira.epics[].key). Úsala como primera señal para el gate de producto de una HU, antes de buscar_producto — si devuelve producto null, la épica no está registrada en ningún producto existente (puede ser un producto nuevo o una épica aún no sincronizada).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["epica"],
        "properties": {
          "epica": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto"],
        "properties": {
          "producto": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "product_id": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "origen": { "type": "string", "enum": ["sources.jira.epics"] }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "buscar_producto",
      "description": "Identifica el/los producto(s) Klap relacionados a un texto libre (p.ej. título+descripción de una HU de Jira).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["texto"],
        "properties": {
          "texto": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["productos"],
        "properties": {
          "productos": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["nombre", "confianza"],
              "properties": {
                "nombre": { "type": "string" },
                "confianza": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "resumen_producto",
      "description": "Memoria resumida y condensada de un producto Klap: capacidades, componentes asociados, clientes, procesos.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto"],
        "properties": {
          "producto": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto", "resumen", "componentes"],
        "properties": {
          "producto": { "type": "string" },
          "resumen": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "fase": { "type": "string" },
          "componentes": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
          "actualizado_en": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "resumen_componente",
      "description": "Memoria resumida de un componente/repositorio: capabilities, dependencias, APIs, relaciones con otros componentes y productos.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["componente"],
        "properties": {
          "componente": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["componente", "resumen"],
        "properties": {
          "componente": { "type": "string" },
          "resumen": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "productos": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
          "dependencias": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
          "actualizado_en": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "buscar",
      "description": "Búsqueda semántica/estructurada de propósito general sobre el grafo de conocimiento (decisiones, ADR, integraciones, procesos).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["consulta"],
        "properties": {
          "consulta": { "type": "string" },
          "tipos": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["producto", "componente", "decision", "api", "proceso", "documento"] }
          },
          "limite": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 50, "default": 10 }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["resultados"],
        "properties": {
          "resultados": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["tipo", "titulo", "extracto"],
              "properties": {
                "tipo": { "type": "string" },
                "titulo": { "type": "string" },
                "extracto": { "type": "string" },
                "relevancia": { "type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1 }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "documentos_relevantes",
      "description": "Devuelve punteros (no el contenido) a documentos de Confluence/ADR relevantes para un componente o consulta, para expandir sólo si Klap Knowledge no fue suficiente.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["consulta"],
        "properties": {
          "consulta": { "type": "string" },
          "componente": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["documentos"],
        "properties": {
          "documentos": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["titulo", "fuente", "referencia"],
              "properties": {
                "titulo": { "type": "string" },
                "fuente": { "type": "string", "enum": ["confluence", "adr", "jira"] },
                "referencia": { "type": "string", "description": "ID o URL para resolver con el MCP de origen (p.ej. Atlassian)." },
                "razon": { "type": "string" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "obtener_producto",
      "description": "Memoria estructurada completa de un producto Klap (equivalente al product.yaml resuelto): identidad, negocio, ecosistema/relaciones, representación técnica y metadata de revisión. Úsala en vez de resumen_producto cuando la tarea necesita el detalle completo, no sólo un resumen condensado.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto"],
        "properties": {
          "producto": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto"],
        "$comment": "Nombres internos en inglés a propósito, idénticos a product.schema.json y memory-patch.schema.json de klap-dev-kit-knowledge — sólo la clave contenedora 'producto' sigue la convención en español del resto de este contrato (como 'producto'/'componente' en las demás tools). Traducir los campos internos obligaría a klap-dev-kit-knowledge a mapear ida y vuelta contra su propio storage sin necesidad.",
        "$defs": {
          "criticality": { "type": "string", "enum": ["low", "medium", "high"] },
          "source_ref": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["type", "ref"],
            "properties": {
              "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["confluence", "jira", "adr", "component-yaml", "manual", "repo"], "_nota": "'component-yaml' deprecado desde 2.3.0, se retira en 3.0.0 — usar 'repo' para evidencia inferida directamente del repositorio/código." },
              "ref": { "type": "string" },
              "version": { "type": "string" },
              "updated_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          }
        },
        "properties": {
          "producto": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "description": "null si el producto no existe en Klap Knowledge.",
            "required": ["id", "name", "status"],
            "properties": {
              "id": { "type": "string" },
              "name": { "type": "string" },
              "aliases": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
              "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["kickoff", "mvp", "fase-1", "mantencion", "deprecado"] }
            }
          },
          "business": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "properties": {
              "description": { "type": "string" },
              "objective": { "type": "string" },
              "target_customers": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
              "value_proposition": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
              "capabilities": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
              "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" } }
            }
          },
          "ecosystem": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "properties": {
              "importance": { "type": "string" },
              "relations": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["product_id", "type", "direction"],
                  "properties": {
                    "product_id": { "type": "string" },
                    "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["depends_on", "depended_by", "integrates_with", "competes_with", "relates_to"] },
                    "direction": { "type": "string", "enum": ["outbound", "inbound"] },
                    "criticality": { "$ref": "#/$defs/criticality" },
                    "description": { "type": "string" },
                    "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" } }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "technical": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "properties": {
              "components": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["component_id", "criticality"],
                  "properties": {
                    "component_id": { "type": "string" },
                    "role": { "type": "string" },
                    "criticality": { "$ref": "#/$defs/criticality" },
                    "repository": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                    "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" } }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "properties": {
              "created_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
              "updated_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
              "revision": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "historial_producto",
      "description": "Eventos históricos relevantes de un producto (creación, cambios de negocio/técnicos/integraciones, decisiones, deprecaciones), orden descendente por fecha. Úsala sólo cuando la tarea necesita contexto histórico explícito — no por defecto.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto"],
        "properties": {
          "producto": { "type": "string" },
          "desde": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "hasta": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "limite": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 200, "default": 50 }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["eventos"],
        "properties": {
          "eventos": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["event_id", "occurred_at", "type", "summary", "sources"],
              "properties": {
                "event_id": { "type": "string" },
                "occurred_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "product_created", "business_change", "functional_change", "technical_change",
                    "integration_change", "component_added", "component_removed", "relation_changed",
                    "decision", "deprecation", "incident_relevant", "documentation_change"
                  ]
                },
                "summary": { "type": "string" },
                "affected_components": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
                "sources": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["type", "ref"],
                    "properties": {
                      "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["confluence", "jira", "adr", "component-yaml", "manual", "repo"], "_nota": "'component-yaml' deprecado desde 2.3.0, se retira en 3.0.0 — usar 'repo' para evidencia inferida directamente del repositorio/código." },
                      "ref": { "type": "string" }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "estado_fuentes",
      "description": "Cursores de sincronización por fuente (Jira/Confluence) para un producto: qué se leyó y cuándo. Sirve para decidir, antes de una actualización incremental, qué fuentes son nuevas o cambiaron sin releer todo.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["producto"],
        "properties": {
          "producto": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["fuentes"],
        "properties": {
          "fuentes": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "jira": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "epics": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": ["key"],
                      "properties": {
                        "key": { "type": "string" },
                        "last_seen_updated_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
                        "last_processed_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "confluence": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "spaces": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": ["key"],
                      "properties": {
                        "key": { "type": "string" },
                        "last_scan_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "pages": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "version": { "type": "string" },
                        "updated_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
                        "content_hash": { "type": "string" }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "aplicar_patch_memoria",
      "description": "Única tool de escritura estructurada sobre la memoria de un producto: recibe un patch ya generado por el agente documentador-klap (con evidencia/fuente por operación) y lo valida/persiste. Nunca se escribe memoria de otra forma — no existe una operación de escritura libre en este contrato.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$comment": "Copia exacta de memory-patch.schema.json (klap-dev-kit-knowledge/schemas/memory-patch.schema.json) al momento de aceptar contractVersion 2.0.0. Es una copia deliberada, no una referencia cruzada entre repos: tools.json debe seguir siendo autocontenido (ver schemas/knowledge-mcp/README.md).",
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["product_id", "expected_revision", "generated_by", "operations"],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "$defs": {
          "entity_id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$" },
          "record_id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9:_-]*$" },
          "criticality": { "type": "string", "enum": ["low", "medium", "high"] },
          "source_ref": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["type", "ref"],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["confluence", "jira", "adr", "component-yaml", "manual", "repo"], "_nota": "'component-yaml' deprecado desde 2.3.0, se retira en 3.0.0 — usar 'repo' para evidencia inferida directamente del repositorio/código." },
              "ref": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
              "version": { "type": "string" },
              "updated_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          },
          "operation": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["op", "value"],
            "properties": { "op": { "type": "string" }, "value": { "type": "object" } },
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "create_product" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["id", "name", "status"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" },
                      "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
                      "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["kickoff", "mvp", "fase-1", "mantencion", "deprecado"] }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "update_identity" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "anyOf": [{ "required": ["name"] }, { "required": ["aliases"] }],
                    "properties": {
                      "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
                      "aliases": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 } }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "update_business" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["sources"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "description": { "type": "string" },
                      "objective": { "type": "string" },
                      "target_customers": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
                      "value_proposition": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
                      "capabilities": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
                      "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" }, "minItems": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "upsert_product_relation" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["product_id", "type", "direction"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "product_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" },
                      "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["depends_on", "depended_by", "integrates_with", "competes_with", "relates_to"] },
                      "direction": { "type": "string", "enum": ["outbound", "inbound"] },
                      "criticality": { "$ref": "#/$defs/criticality" },
                      "description": { "type": "string" },
                      "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" } }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "remove_product_relation" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["product_id", "type"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "product_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" },
                      "type": { "type": "string" }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "upsert_component" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["component_id", "name", "status", "summary", "sources"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "component_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" },
                      "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
                      "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["primary", "secondary"] },
                      "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "deprecated", "planned"] },
                      "repository": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                      "summary": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
                      "dependencies": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "required": ["component_id", "type"],
                          "additionalProperties": false,
                          "properties": {
                            "component_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" },
                            "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["depends_on", "depended_by"] },
                            "criticality": { "$ref": "#/$defs/criticality" },
                            "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" } }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" }, "minItems": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "upsert_component_link" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["component_id", "criticality"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "component_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" },
                      "role": { "type": "string" },
                      "criticality": { "$ref": "#/$defs/criticality" },
                      "repository": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
                      "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" } }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "remove_component_link" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["component_id"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": { "component_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" } }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "op": { "const": "append_event" },
                  "value": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["event_id", "occurred_at", "type", "summary", "sources", "created_by"],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "event_id": { "$ref": "#/$defs/record_id" },
                      "occurred_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
                      "type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "product_created", "business_change", "functional_change", "technical_change",
                          "integration_change", "component_added", "component_removed", "relation_changed",
                          "decision", "deprecation", "incident_relevant", "documentation_change"
                        ]
                      },
                      "summary": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
                      "sources": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/source_ref" }, "minItems": 1 },
                      "affected_components": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/entity_id" } },
